  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/12/IMG_1385.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><font face=\"Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#002000\">(</font></font><font face=\"Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#002000\">25 fotos y un v&iacute;deo) <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y3MgWmmNGH0\" target=\"_blank\">La tarde de este viernes ha abierto<span style=\"text-align: left; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; word-spacing: 0px; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; float: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: transparent;\"> sus puertas en la calle Balmes de Onda, </span></a></font></font><font face=\"Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; word-spacing: 0px; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; float: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: transparent;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y3MgWmmNGH0\" target=\"_blank\">frente a la Casa de Cultura, el Centro Dharma</a>, regentado por Lourdes Ventura Benages y especializado en meditaci&oacute;n, relajaci&oacute;n, sanaci&oacute;n, mindfulness, Reiki, yoga, masajes y otras terapias.</span></font></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/12/IMG_1421.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><font face=\"Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; word-spacing: 0px; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; float: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: transparent;\">Tras la visita a las completas instalaciones del centro y las palabras de la anfitriona ha habido un concierto de m&uacute;sica a cargo del d&uacute;o Vibrant Silence, formado por &Iacute;ngrid Faustini y H&eacute;ctor Casero.</span></font></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1385.jpg\" alt=\"img_1385\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1388.jpg\" alt=\"img_1388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1389.jpg\" alt=\"img_1389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1390.jpg\" alt=\"img_1390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1391.jpg\" alt=\"img_1391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1393.jpg\" alt=\"img_1393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1395.jpg\" alt=\"img_1395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1396.jpg\" alt=\"img_1396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/img_1397.jpg\" alt=\"img_1397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugcentrodharmaonda/